<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - TJX Cos started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - TJX Cos started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley has initiated coverage of TJX Cos with an outperform rating, the brokerage firm said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley analyst Sharon Pearson has set a 12-month price target of 55 on shares of the Framingham, Mass.-based apparel retailer.</p>
<p>-- Pearson also estimated the company will post earnings of $2.90 per share in 1997 and $3.30 per share in 1998.</p>
<p>-- TJX shares closed at 45-3/4 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
